{"unit_id":"XcodeFish__dsh-file-link-menu#card-zh","repo":"XcodeFish/dsh-file-link-menu","commit":"6d2a65a6399a94d320ac7607159ca72c7ece144d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-link-menu 是一个用于 DSH Web 客户端的文件引用右键菜单插件。它在聊天界面的会话工具栏和输入区挂载客户端模块，并识别 DSH 资源链接、带文件路径标记的元素、Markdown 文件链接按钮，以及代码块之外的行内文件路径。用户右键后可查看系统关联应用并选择打开文件、在文件管理器中显示文件位置，或复制绝对路径和相对路径；代码块、普通文本和外部链接保留浏览器原生菜单。文件操作通过 DSH Session Remote 完成，路径可结合会话工作目录解析。适合经常从聊天回答跳转到项目源码的开发者；不需要 API 密钥或额外外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:300-342","client.js:218-251","client.js:378-410"]}
{"unit_id":"XcodeFish__dsh-file-link-menu#card-en","repo":"XcodeFish/dsh-file-link-menu","commit":"6d2a65a6399a94d320ac7607159ca72c7ece144d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-file-link-menu adds a right-click menu for file references in the DSH web client. It recognizes resource links, marked paths, file-link buttons and inline paths, then offers app-based opening, file-manager reveal and path copying.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:300-342","client.js:218-251","client.js:378-410"]}
