{"unit_id":"XcodeFish__dsh-file-link-menu#feature-1","repo":"XcodeFish/dsh-file-link-menu","commit":"6d2a65a6399a94d320ac7607159ca72c7ece144d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-link-menu 的功能「识别聊天文件引用」：右键 DSH 资源链接、文件路径标记、文件链接按钮或行内代码路径时识别目标；代码块、普通文本及外部链接不接管原生菜单。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:300-342","client.js:357-371"]}
