{"unit_id":"XcodeFish__dsh-file-link-menu#feature-4","repo":"XcodeFish/dsh-file-link-menu","commit":"6d2a65a6399a94d320ac7607159ca72c7ece144d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-link-menu 的功能「复制文件路径」：在右键菜单选择绝对路径或相对路径，插件将对应文本复制到剪贴板；无法使用 Clipboard API 时会尝试传统复制方式。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:148-164","client.js:218-238"]}
{"unit_id":"XcodeFish__dsh-file-link-menu#caveat-1","repo":"XcodeFish/dsh-file-link-menu","commit":"6d2a65a6399a94d320ac7607159ca72c7ece144d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-link-menu 的使用前须知：打开或定位文件依赖 DSH Host 提供的 Session Remote 会话接口，相关菜单在接口不可用时不会显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:218-232","client.js:380-410"]}
